{"product_id":"postevand-x-forlaget-virkelig","title":"Postevand x Forlaget Virkelig","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIn this special release you get to discover the captivating work of Kim Stanley Robinson, an acclaimed American science fiction author. Time Magazine recognized him as a \"Hero of the Environment\" for his visionary storytelling, ecological consciousness, and future-historical perspectives.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIn 2021, Robinson was invited to COP26, where he contributed with the text \"Remembering Climate Change - A Message from the Year 2071.\" This powerful narrative reveals how humanity confronted the climate crisis and took charge of the biosphere. Now, this impactful story is available in Danish translation.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e","brand":"Postevand","offers":[{"title":"One Size","offer_id":46987804836175,"sku":"","price":85.0,"currency_code":"DKK","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1721\/2643\/files\/BookFront.png?v=1690969235","url":"https:\/\/postevand.com\/products\/postevand-x-forlaget-virkelig","provider":"Postevand","version":"1.0","type":"link"}